From: Martin Matyas <martin.matyas@tietoevry.com>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 16:58:51 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 22/23] Emscripten: attribute-less screen blit
 (MZ_WASM_EXP_BLIT)

Draw the emulator screen as one triangle generated from gl_VertexID (no
vertex/index buffers) right after the clear, and let ImGui draw only its
UI on top. Bisection switch for a mobile driver (Samsung Xclipse 940,
ANGLE/Vulkan) that renders half of ImGui's textured quad with zeroed
attributes.
